# Shoreline Looter, 1/1 "can't be blocked": Ornithopter can't block it (CR 509.1b). "Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a
# player, draw a card. Then discard a card unless there are seven or more cards in your graveyard" (CR 207.2c). Its first hit on
# turn 3 draws and discards (graveyard 1). Bot2's Mind Twist for five on turn 4 empties Bot1's hand of five Islands into the
# graveyard (6 cards): the hit on turn 5 is still below seven and discards (7), and the hit on turn 7 at exactly seven draws and
# keeps everything (hand 2 + 1).

